    "08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-title-1": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "title": "🖌️ My Custom Artwork"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-1": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1.  Is my photo good enough to use?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>If you follow our Photo Guide, your photo is likely perfect! We look for clear, eye-level shots with natural lighting.</p><p><br/><strong>For Pets Who Have Passed:</strong> We understand that sometimes you only have one precious photo. If it’s old, blurry, or in Black & White, please contact us first. <br/></p><p>Our team will evaluate it for free to see if we can capture the likeness accurately. We’d rather be honest with you than deliver a portrait that isn't perfect.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-2": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. How does the preview and revision process work?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>We want you to be 100% in love with your art. That’s why you’re part of the journey!<br/><br/><strong>The Preview</strong>: You’ll receive a digital proof via email.<br/><br/><strong>Unlimited Tweaks</strong>: We offer unlimited minor revisions (adjusting colors, names, or small details) until you’re happy.<br/><br/><strong>Photo/Style Swaps: </strong>You can change your reference photo or artwork style for free <strong>only if our artists have not yet begun working on your portrait</strong>(typically within the first 6 hours of placing your order). Once the illustration process has started, any request to change the photo or style will require a<strong>$10 Artwork Recreation Fee</strong>. This fee goes directly to our artists to compensate them for the time already invested and covers the cost of starting a new piece from scratch.<br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_ThK4NV": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Is this a filter or hand-drawn?",
            "content": "No filters or AI shortcuts here! Each portrait is 100% Digital Hand-Drawn. Our artists use an iPad and Apple Pencil to meticulously trace every whisker and capture the unique \"soul\" of your pet, stroke by stroke. This allows for high-resolution details that look stunning on any size.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_cX8wbH": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Can I add or remove details (Collars, Crowns, etc.)?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p><strong>What we CAN remove:</strong> We can easily edit out everyday items like leashes, harnesses, or standard collars to give your portrait a clean, timeless look. We can also clean up minor details like red-eye or small blemishes. Just leave a specific note in the \"Notes to Artist\" box! <em>(Tip: For the best results without a collar, providing a photo of your pet already collar-free is always preferred).</em></p><p><strong>What we CANNOT add or change:</strong> Because our artists illustrate directly from your reference photo to capture your pet's true likeness, we <strong>cannot add new accessories</strong> (like crowns, hats, or props) that aren't in the original picture. We also cannot perform major structural edits, such as opening a closed mouth, adding a smile, or changing ear positions.</p><p><strong>Existing Accessories:</strong> If your pet is already wearing a cute accessory in the photo you provide (like a bandana or hair bow), our artists will happily include it in the artwork!</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_ecfWPb": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Can I have multiple pets in one portrait?",
            "content": "The more the merrier! We can comfortably fit a whole \"fur family\" into one masterpiece.\n\nThe Big Family Deal: We offer special pricing for multiple pets. For large groups, our 4+ pet option is capped at the same price as 4 pets—making it the best value for large pet families!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_NRmtPR": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. Do you only draw dogs and cats?",
            "content": "If it has a face, we can draw it! We’ve created masterpieces for dogs, cats, birds, horses, and even reptiles. Humans are welcome too—whether it’s a solo portrait or a \"Pet & Parent\" duo.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-3": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "7. Do you offer human portraits?",
            "content": "Yes! We can draw pets with their owners, or even just humans (solo, couples, or families). Our artists are skilled in capturing the essence of both pets and people.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-4": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "8. Can I see the artwork before it gets printed?",
            "content": "Absolutely! We believe you should be 100% in love with your custom art. That is why you are a part of the process from start to finish. We will send you a digital preview of your portrait to review. If it’s not perfect yet, don't worry—we offer unlimited revisions. We will never send anything to print without your final approval and complete satisfaction!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_fwgJ3m": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "9. Can I change my order after it has been placed?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>Yes, we understand that changes are sometimes necessary! Please contact us within 12-24 hours of placing your order. Depending on what you need to adjust, here are our guidelines:<br/><br/><strong>Shipping Information:</strong> We can update your shipping address or phone number as long as you reach out before your final artwork is sent to print. Once the order is in the printing and fulfillment phase, we can no longer redirect the package.<br/><br/><strong>Design Details:</strong> Need to fix a typo in your pet's name, switch the background color, or change the frame? Contact us ASAP. These changes must also be requested before the final proof goes to print.<br/><strong><br/>Changing the Pet Photo: </strong>You can swap your reference photo for free only if our artists haven't started illustrating yet. If the drawing process has already begun, changing the photo will require an additional artwork fee. To avoid this, please review our Photo Guide before ordering. If you're unsure, feel free to send us a few photos—our team would be happy to help you pick the perfect one!<br/><br/><strong>Changing Product or Size:</strong> If you want to change the canvas size or switch to a different product entirely, the price will vary. Please reach out to our support team so we can cancel your current order and help you place a new one with the correct details.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_9ecdVa": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "10. Do you create pet memorial portraits?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>Yes, we absolutely do. It is a profound honor for our team to help you preserve the memory of a beloved companion who has crossed the rainbow bridge.</p><p>Our artists put extra care and love into these special pieces. Upon request, we can beautifully and respectfully incorporate elements like a delicate halo or angel wings into the portrait. We hope to provide you with a timeless, comforting tribute to the unconditional love they brought into your life. Please just leave a note for our artists when placing your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-title-2": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "title": "📦 Production and Shipping"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-5": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. How long does the entire process take?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>Total delivery time = Design + Production + Shipping.<br/><br/><strong>Design & Preview</strong>: 1–3 Business Days.<br/><br/><strong>Production:</strong> 2–4 Business Days (starts after you approve your artwork).<br/><br/><strong>Shipping:</strong> Once shipped, delivery takes:<br/><br/>🇺🇸 USA: 4–8 Business Days.<br/><br/>🇬🇧 UK / 🇨🇦 Canada / 🇦🇺 Australia / 🇪🇺 Europe: 1 - 3 weeks.<br/><br/>International: 2-4 weeks.<br/><br/><strong>Note on Approval:</strong> To ensure timely delivery, we allow 3 days for you to approve or request changes. If we don't hear back after multiple reminders, we will proceed to print to avoid further delays.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-6": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. What are the shipping fees?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>We are thrilled to offer FREE standard shipping for all US orders over $100! </p><p>For US orders under $100, as well as all international orders, shipping fees are automatically calculated at checkout based on your exact location and the items in your cart.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_4G8Wpk": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Where is my order shipped from?",
            "content": "We are proud to say that all physical orders are printed and shipped directly from our facilities within the USA. This ensures the highest quality control and faster transit times for our domestic customers.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-7": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Will I receive a tracking number?",
            "content": "Yes, absolutely! Once you approve your final artwork, we immediately send it to print. It typically takes about 2 to 4 business days for your custom piece to be produced and a tracking number to be generated. As soon as it's ready, we will send you a shipping confirmation email so you can follow your artwork's journey home!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_YhKyLX": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Which payment methods do you accept?",
            "content": "We accept all major debit and credit cards including Visa, Visa Debit, Mastercard, American Express and more. We also accept PayPal payments.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_yp9hG4": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. Why isn't my tracking number updating?",
            "content": "Don't worry! When your shipping label is first created, it can take 24 to 48 hours for the carrier's system to scan the package and update the tracking status online. If your tracking hasn't updated after a couple of days, please reach out to us and we'll happily look into it for you!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_yWtiwf": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "7. If I order multiple items, will they arrive in the same package?",
            "content": "Not always. Because we offer a variety of specialized custom products (such as framed canvases, phone cases, and blankets), your items may be produced in different printing facilities to ensure the highest quality. As a result, they might arrive in separate packages and on different days. You will receive a separate tracking number for each package, so you can track all your goodies!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-title-3": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "title": "🛡️ Returns and refunds"
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-9": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. Do you offer refunds? / What if I don't like the artwork?",
            "content": "Because your order is 100% custom-made for your pet, we cannot accept returns or refunds once production begins.\n\nOur Guarantee: We offer unlimited minor revisions during the preview stage. We will not print your order until you give us your 100% approval. This ensures you’ll love the final result before it’s ever shipped!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20718015545618__08421e50-b348-46a3-bbb7-5b26be196b6c-accordion_item-a": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. Can I cancel my order?",
            "content": "-",
            "content_richtext": "<p>Yes, but timing is everything:<br/><br/><strong>Within 24 hours of purchase:</strong> You are eligible for a 100% full refund, no questions asked.<br/><br/><strong>After 24 hours:</strong> If our artists have already started your portrait, a $10 service fee will be deducted from your refund to cover the labor costs. Once you have approved the artwork for printing, cancellations are no longer possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_TVY7qm": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. What if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?",
            "content": "While we pack our portraits securely, accidents can happen. We will send a free replacement immediately if your item arrives damaged or if we made a mistake (wrong size/design).\n\nImportant: Please get in touch with us at contact@painterful.com within 48 hours of delivery with a photo of the damage. This allows us to file a claim with the courier and speed up your replacement.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_MVNMVi": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. My tracking says \"Delivered\" but I can't find my package. What do I do?",
            "content": "Don't panic! First, please check with neighbors or your building management. If it’s still missing:\n\nContact us within 3 days of the \"Delivered\" timestamp. We will help you open an investigation with the carrier.\n\nNote: While we aren't responsible for \"Porch Piracy\" (theft after delivery), we always strive to help our customers. Contact us so we can find a solution together.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "96d06894-2378-432e-9a7c-721d0af64eb5": {
          "type": "other_link",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Contact us",
            "link": "shopify://pages/contact-us"
          }
        }
      },
